WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.760
Step 1.

1.2
00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:06.874
In the facility sidebar, select Settings, then Referral availability under Clinical.

1.3
00:00:06.874 --> 00:00:13.489
Here you can change a referral availability, stop new referrals to it, or delete it.

2.1
00:00:13.489 --> 00:00:18.303
Step 2. To find one by name, type in Search referral availability.

2.2
00:00:18.303 --> 00:00:23.075
The list shows the referral availability of the place that you chose,

2.3
00:00:23.075 --> 00:00:26.203
including the Draft and Inactive ones.

3.1
00:00:26.203 --> 00:00:29.557
Step 3. Select Edit at the right of the row.

3.2
00:00:29.557 --> 00:00:35.137
Care opens the Edit referral availability sheet with the current values.

4.1
00:00:35.137 --> 00:00:35.880
Step 4.

4.2
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:41.518
Set Status to Inactive to stop new referrals and keep the referral availability.

4.3
00:00:41.518 --> 00:00:45.824
Senders then cannot find it in the Referral unit list.

5.1
00:00:45.824 --> 00:00:50.491
Step 6. Select Save Changes at the bottom right of the sheet.

5.2
00:00:50.491 --> 00:00:56.496
Care shows Referral availability updated, and the row shows the new details.

6.1
00:00:56.496 --> 00:00:57.222
Step 7.

6.2
00:00:57.222 --> 00:01:02.595
Select the red trash button on the row, then Delete availability in the dialog.

6.3
00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:08.128
Care removes it from the list, and keeps the referrals already sent to it.
